    "detailed_description": "Tracing Decay is an online art museum with multiple galleries featuring artworks from the selected world renown artists:<br />\r\nBarbara Graf 's Anatomical Bodies <br />\r\nHuda Lutfi's Dreams <br />\r\nDaniel Reidy's Collateral Agendas<br />\r\nDaniel Reidy featuring Greg Pond in Piano Burial<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBrowse their featured paintings and sculptures in a curated environment that contrasts their work and tells the story that links their work together.<br />\r\nFind the hidden videos by the artists, enjoy the art work, and experience it in your own way - find your own story out of it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe selected art works have been scanned and recreated to a photorealistic quality for the work to be enjoyed as if you're standing in front of it in real life. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nVisit our website for more information on the artists and their work.",
    "about_the_game": "Tracing Decay is an online art museum with multiple galleries featuring artworks from the selected world renown artists:<br />\r\nBarbara Graf 's Anatomical Bodies <br />\r\nHuda Lutfi's Dreams <br />\r\nDaniel Reidy's Collateral Agendas<br />\r\nDaniel Reidy featuring Greg Pond in Piano Burial<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBrowse their featured paintings and sculptures in a curated environment that contrasts their work and tells the story that links their work together.<br />\r\nFind the hidden videos by the artists, enjoy the art work, and experience it in your own way - find your own story out of it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe selected art works have been scanned and recreated to a photorealistic quality for the work to be enjoyed as if you're standing in front of it in real life. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nVisit our website for more information on the artists and their work.",
    "short_description": "Tracing Decay is a dark dystopian simulation, that revisits impactful art that revolves around themes of decay, memory loss and recollection. The experience allows the player to explore the environment freely in search for several galleries within the ruins.",
